+# Invoice review
+
+## Purpose
+
+This service identifies invoice-total anomalies for an operator to review. Given an invoice total and an expected total, it reports their difference and whether they differ.
+
+## Users
+
+Operators review the reported invoice anomalies.
+
+## Boundaries
+
+The service does not approve payment or change an invoice.
